### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Get one book (Don Quijote)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/6a1127d9e97c81248902b299

### Create book
POST http://localhost:3000/books HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Don Quijote de la Mancha",
  "author": "Miguel de Cervantes",
  "genre": "Classic",
  "yearPublished": 1605,
  "summary": "A nobleman becomes a knight-errant and embarks on humorous adventures.",
  "editorial": "Francisco de Robles",
  "numberOfPages": 863
}

### PUT book (update Don Quijote)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/6a1127d9e97c81248902b299 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Don Quijote de la Mancha (Updated)",
  "author": "Miguel de Cervantes",
  "genre": "Classic",
  "yearPublished": 1605,
  "summary": "Updated summary for testing.",
  "editorial": "Francisco de Robles",
  "numberOfPages": 863
}

### DELETE book (Don Quijote)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/6a1127d9e97c81248902b299

